{
  "slug": "swift-focusengine-pro",
  "name": "Swift Focusengine Pro",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Expert focus management guidance for all Apple platforms (tvOS, iOS/iPadOS, watchOS, visionOS). Covers SwiftUI, UIKit, and RealityKit focus APIs including @FocusState, UIFocusEnvironment, UIFocusGuide, focusSection, HoverEffect, Digital Crown routing, and 14 critical anti-patterns that break focus navigation. Built from real-world experience shipping production tvOS apps. 2,100+ lines of reference material across 10 files covering focus styling, focus restoration, layout patterns, and debugging techniques.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `swift-focusengine-pro` (Reviews, writes, and fixes focus management code for all Apple platforms (tvOS, iOS/iPadOS, watchOS, visionOS, macOS), covering SwiftUI,…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install swift-focusengine-pro@claude-community` from `mhaviv/Swift-FocusEngine-Agent-Skill`.",
